The system introduces something called repair terms.

11:31.140 --> 11:32.140
Repair terms.

11:32.340 --> 11:38.420
A repair term records exactly how a block continuation can be transformed into an admissible one.

11:38.420 --> 11:42.640
Okay, give me a concrete example of how a repair term works under the hood. Like, what does

